  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Symposium - 2022 Indo-Pacific Business Forum Technical Symposium, through Tuatara Group, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contract funds the Indo-Pacific Business Forum (IPBF), which brings together senior United States (U.S.) and regional government officials with business officials to advance the objectives of the Indo-Pacific vision. The Forum would be held as a virtual event, with a small-scale in-person element held in Tokyo, Japan, and include representatives from across the Indo-Pacific.</narrative>
  </description>
